<<
/A 1774 0 R
/Alt (Data visualization of Host Cell Protein \(HCP\) analysis across different purification steps and products. A: Bar chart showing HCP species concentration for three clones \(products A and B\) at various harvest stages. B: Pie charts displaying total and mean HCP amount by type, with non-core and core categories. C: Scatter plot correlating relative ATP cost \(transcript-scaled vs. abundance-scaled\), highlighting specific proteins like EEF1A1 and FN1. D: Bar chart of HCP concentration decrease across purification steps. E: Bar chart depicting the number of HCP species per purification step. F: Bar chart showing percentage reduction of HCP at each step.)
