<<
/A 1835 0 R
/Alt (A detailed infographic showing a multi-step process for gene knockout in host cell proteins \(HCPs\) and the resulting impacts on bioprocess performance. Panel A illustrates the experimental workflow for CRISPR-mediated knockout screening. Panel B displays a bar graph of the screening results for various clones. Panel C and D provide box plots and scatter plots showing knockout scores, with references to a cutoff level. Panel E presents a line graph tracking knockout scores over different stages. Panel F consists of bar charts depicting the fold changes for different gene targets. Panel G utilizes an upset plot to demonstrate intersections of gene sets, and Panel H is a correlation heatmap of various bioprocess metrics.)
/K [0 1836 0 R]
/P 136 0 R
/Pg 52 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 2)
/Type /StructElem
